{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act46side_level_act46side_01_end","storyGroup":"act46side","storySort":3,"storyDependence":"act46side_level_act46side_01_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OS-1","storyName":"呼号声中","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"诺希斯前往莱茵生命观测站询问天灾成因，埃琳娜发现天灾发生前的观测记录被刻意修改，研究员卡罗琳也下落不明。紧接着，愤怒的谢拉格民众包围了观测站。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act46side/level_act46side_01_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act46side_01","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":1,"next":3,"characters":["缪尔赛思","赫默","？？？","诺希斯","能量科研究员","埃琳娜","村民的声音"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_bg_67_G3_rhineobservatory_i.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.7","keep":"true","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"dialog","id":10},{"type":"animtext","id":11,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>谢拉格-莱茵生命观测站</><p=2>两个月前</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":12},{"type":"animtextclean","id":13},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#7$1","duration":"0.7","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"哇......建得真快，这个规模的观测站居然这么点时间就搭出来了......","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"这样的工程体量，商务科这回怕是要大出血了吧。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1031_slent2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫默","text":"谢拉格观测站的议案在委员会投票通过后的第一时间，就有两位数的金融机构找了上来。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_1031_slent2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫默","text":"这样看来，经费反而是这次项目中最不需要担心的环节。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_1031_slent2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"赫默，老实说......我本来以为这项提案在委员会那边没这么容易通过呢。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1031_slent2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫默","text":"......我犹豫过，我仍然坚持认为现在莱茵生命对于“星荚”的研究进度还是算得上激进，还有许多潜在的问题我们都没有考虑周全。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6E/Avg_avg_1031_slent2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫默","text":"可是我也认识到，或许我期待的那个稳定的局面永远不会到来。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6E/Avg_avg_1031_slent2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫默","text":"不管任何时候，我们能相信的只能是具体的人。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6E/Avg_avg_1031_slent2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"那我要感谢你的信任啦，赫默委员。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0A/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1031_slent2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫默","text":"希望我们做的这一切，都是有价值的......","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_1031_slent2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"当然啦，对于整个莱茵生命来说这个观测站都是绝无仅有的机会吧。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"除了星荚的研究，谢拉格低源石浓度的环境也是很难得的生物研究环境。还有马里亚姆！他也一直说早就想来喀兰雪山看看了。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"就连斐尔迪南，拿到观测站的立项通知后，只用了两周的时间就给出了观测站核心能量井的供能方案。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"不过之后他就又一头扎进他的理论研究里去了，负责后续落地工作的是能量科的埃琳娜。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1031_slent2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫默","text":"希望在考察之外，和谢拉格方面的相处也可以顺利......","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_1031_slent2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":41},{"type":"charslot","id":42},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_glassdooropen","id":43},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":44},{"type":"dialog","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我想这一点就不劳各位学者操心了。","id":46},{"type":"text","text":"观测站的大门从外侧打开，来人扫去肩头落下的雪花，走入室内。","id":47},{"type":"dialog","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"又见面了，诺希斯先生。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"例行访问，来确认观测站的修建工作是否有需要帮助的地方......","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"不过看上去，这里的进度十分理想。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":57},{"type":"charslot","id":58},{"type":"text","text":"诺希斯抬起头，莱茵生命观测站光洁而宽阔的吊顶之上镶嵌着散发柔光的灯带。","id":59},{"type":"text","text":"莱茵生命与喀兰贸易合力，在短得不可思议的时间内搭建起了这座结实又光亮的小殿堂。","id":60},{"type":"text","text":"外形特殊、先锋，和谢拉格的民居相比如同来自未来的造物。","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"喀兰贸易会尽一切可能协助莱茵生命推进观测站的项目，也愿意在工作之外为各位提供必要的帮助。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"只要莱茵生命不违背条约中的共识，各位在谢拉格的活动就可以畅通无阻。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1031_slent2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫默","text":"......谢谢您的好意，诺希斯先生。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6E/Avg_avg_1031_slent2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫默","text":"莱茵生命只是一个科研公司，除了科学研究外不会有任何别的目的。我想我们没有理由主动破坏条约。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6E/Avg_avg_1031_slent2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"......当然，我也是这样相信的。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"像这样的跨国合作，在整个泰拉都没有先例，这样的初次尝试必然会有重重阻碍......","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"我只是想强调，只要我们双方在科研信息上保持必要的坦诚，类似特里蒙那样的意外情况，完全可以避免。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1031_slent2_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫默","text":"......","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_1031_slent2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"对了！圣女大人会来观测站访问吗？","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"等观测站正式落成的时候，圣女应该会出席相关的仪式......您想见圣女大人，是有什么事吗？","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"哎呀，没有什么严肃的理由啦，只是有点好奇。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0A/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"我还记得上次拜访圣女大人的时候，她一开始还对我们的合作项目十分抵触，可后来忽然之间就同意了。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0A/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"我有点好奇，她到底是因为什么才转变了想法，一直都想找个机会问问她呢。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0A/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"圣女平日工作繁忙，如果您想和圣女交流的话，可以抽空去参与一下本地的仪式活动......如果您感兴趣的话。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"圣女和蔓珠院的长老都会很乐意招待各位......如果各位有这样的打算，我会代为安排。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"好周到，您真是适合做这份工作~","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"基本的地主之谊，这是谢拉格应该做的。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"各位应该都会在谢拉格留一段时间，我们都希望这是一段没有麻烦......愉快的合作。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"多谢您的体贴，如果没有您的帮助，这次的合作很难进展得如此顺利。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"不，不是帮助。是达成我们共同的目标。缪尔赛思小姐。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"喀兰贸易为你们连接谢拉格的山峰，铺设方便前来的路与行动的自由。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"按照约定，莱茵生命会共享研究本地生态得出的部分数据，协助本土药物研发。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"当然，菲茨罗伊主任会针对合同的细节和喀兰贸易详谈的。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"我只是个研究员，没那么善于交际。只希望能让您相信，莱茵生命是带着绝对友好的态度来到这片神圣的土地的。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"至少在这一点上，我们应该没有区别。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":102},{"type":"charslot","id":103},{"type":"text","text":"二人握手，相互点头，脸上带着笑。如同所有下方题注着“展开友好合作”的新闻照一样。","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"不必有太多担忧......","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"只要遵守契约，我们就仍是“朋友”。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":109},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":110},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":111},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"charslot","id":113},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_bg_38_g5_rhinelab_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":114},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":116},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":117,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":118},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1","duration":"0.7","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2007_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2007_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能量科研究员","text":"埃琳娜组长，喀兰贸易的代表来了。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_2007_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能量科研究员","text":"他们要求尽快与莱茵生命代表进行会面。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_2007_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1","focus":"l","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"为什么？我们近期应该没有与喀兰贸易开会的安排吧？","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"......是因为天灾？","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2007_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能量科研究员","text":"嗯......","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_2007_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能量科研究员","text":"他们希望能就天灾的成因和莱茵生命进行讨论，至少希望我们可以提供观测站的观测数据。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_2007_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"我明白了......","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D3/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1","focus":"l","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"对了，你见到卡罗琳前辈了吗？观测数据应该是她在负责吧？","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2007_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能量科研究员","text":"这就是......另一个想找您确认的问题了。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_2007_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能量科研究员","text":"从昨天上午开始，我们就没有人见到过她......","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_2007_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"什么......？","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A5/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":141},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"charslot","id":144},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_bg_67_G3_rhineobservatory_i.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":146},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":"0.8","id":147},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"突然带着侍卫包围了观测站，并且要求所有研究员集合在大厅接受“询问”。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"这就是喀兰贸易对待朋友的态度吗，诺希斯先生？","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"charslot","id":154},{"type":"text","text":"宽敞的前厅之中，研究员们三三两两地站成一片，集中在厅堂内侧。","id":155},{"type":"text","text":"另一头，诺希斯带着希瓦艾什家的侍卫占据了靠近大门的外侧空间。","id":156},{"type":"text","text":"两群人之间自然而然地割裂出一道界限，如同被河流分割的两片土地。","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"是“请求”，而非“要求”......至少从结果来看，并不是所有研究员都在这里。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"我不明白，诺希斯先生，您要找的是哪一位研究员？","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"......","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"一位之前被发现，出现在谢拉格军事禁区的研究员。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":166},{"type":"charslot","id":167},{"type":"text","text":"诺希斯的视线扫过研究员们，一个一个地确认着他们的面目。","id":168},{"type":"text","text":"高大的侍卫沉默不语，研究员们无声地相互交换眼神。","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"......但是她现在并不在这里。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"看上去，莱茵生命并没有办法完全掌握每一位研究员的行踪。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"诺希斯先生，如果您是在怀疑莱茵生命内部存在某种间谍行为，我们希望您可以通过正式的流程提出起诉。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"像今天这样突然的事态，请原谅我们是没有办法配合您的调查的。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"当然......我今天来这里，还为另外一件事。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"相信各位已经有所听闻，几个小时前，谢拉格境内发生了一起天灾。这是长久以来谢拉格未曾发生的事。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"恐慌情绪正在蔓延，谢拉格的一切新事物都很容易挑动民众敏感的神经......你们应该明白我的意思。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"我相信诺希斯先生不会是“神经敏感”的其中之一，对吗？","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"......","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"我，或者说喀兰贸易对这件事的看法并不重要。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"重要的是，人们在等待一个解释。我也希望能够和各位一起查明这起天灾背后的成因。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"charslot","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"那诺希斯先生恐怕要失望了。","id":188},{"type":"dialog","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1","duration":"1","id":190},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"我刚刚检查过观测站的各项观测数据，在天灾发生前的七十二小时内，没有任何一项数据表现出异常。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"也就是说，这片土地上发生了千年来都未曾发生过的天灾，但是观测站没有检测到任何有关的异常？","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E5/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"没错，仅从观测数据来看，这就是事实。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"埃琳娜？","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"没关系的，既然诺希斯先生想要问，那就说清楚好了。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"建立在此处的观测站，主要目的在于观测研究“星荚”，而非其他。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"根据现有的研究成果，没有任何发现指向星荚与天灾之间存在任何关系。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"同样，如果有人认为建立在此处的观测站会为谢拉格带来天灾，那更是缺少论证的、主观性的臆测。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"（等......等一下！埃琳娜，这个时候可不能再吵架了呀！）","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"抱歉，我接下来要说的话可能有些失礼。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"......不用顾虑，请说吧。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":212},{"type":"charslot","id":213},{"type":"text","text":"少女的声音平稳，目光坚定，不见转移。","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"那我不妨把话说得再明白一点吧。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"尽管有违谢拉格基于信仰的认知，但是从科学常理来看，所谓“忽如其来”的天灾并不能算作异常。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"谢拉格长久的平静，以及把这种平静当作理所当然的态度，才是一种“异常”。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1","focus":"n","id":219},{"type":"text","text":"巨大的前厅内安静得落针可闻，长走廊的另一头隐约反射回埃琳娜话语的回音。","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"在观测站建立之初，莱茵生命曾经考虑过加入天灾预警功能的模块。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"但很遗憾，出于对过往经验的轻信，我们将这一模块建立的优先级进行了后置。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"如果说还有什么补救措施的话......","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"莱茵生命与喀兰贸易双方应当重新协商，尽快在谢拉格境内打造完备的天灾预警系统——这才是当务之急。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"......","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"精彩的见地，这位能量科的......埃琳娜小姐。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"我完全认同你的见解，喀兰贸易会尽快开始准备建立天灾预警系统。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"那么，喀兰贸易希望拷贝一份观测站近一个月来的观测数据来留档......方便配合吗？","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"......当然。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"请稍等，诺希斯先生。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":237},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":238},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"charslot","id":241},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_bg_38_g5_rhinelab_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":243},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":244,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":245},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"呼......","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"我还从来不知道，原来埃琳娜还有这样的一面呀。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"抱歉......缪尔赛思主任，我刚才，是不是太冲动了......","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A5/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"唔......应该有那么一点？","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"我只是有些生气，为什么不管在什么地方，总是会出现科学要为完全非科学的认知做解释的情况......","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A5/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"可有些时候，科学距离群众就是非常遥远的。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"让我们困扰的这些人和事，其实也是这片大地的一部分，我们不该视而不见。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"用赫默常说的那句话，“科学应该真切地看向每一个人”，对吧？","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"我明白......可是这真的很荒唐——","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A5/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"唉......先不说啦，还是先把需要的数据整理好吧。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"数据，数据......就算整理出来也不会有什么意外的......","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D3/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":268},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"等等......这一张图——","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BA/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":271},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","volume":"1","id":272},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":273},{"type":"text","text":"埃琳娜将散落得到处都是的稿纸规整起来，密密麻麻的波谱图上，一小段曲线引起了她的注意。","id":274},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":275,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"这不可能......","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"怎么了？","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"这台观测仪，是用高能粒子束持续轰击星荚，通过收集电磁辐射来研究星荚的结构......","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A5/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"可我刚刚才发现，12月7日凌晨三点到四点之间的数据，与4日同一时间的数据，是完全一样的......","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A5/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"是很特殊的巧合？","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"不......应该说，是绝对不可能发生的事。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"就像自然界中不可能找到两片一模一样的雪花，大气中的电磁辐射每分每秒都在发生变化......","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"但是不同的两天之中的同一时段，整整一个小时内都显示一模一样的波段，只有一种可能......","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"这一段数据，被人修改过。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"通过伪造数据来论证猜想？可就是想要学术造假，这也应该是项目非常后期才会做的事......","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"你能想到有谁会这么做吗？","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_249_mlyss_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"12月7日......天灾发生的前一天......","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":295},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.3","fadetime":"2","id":296},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":297},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":298},{"type":"charslot","id":299},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_bg_67_G3_rhineobservatory_i.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":300},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.7","keep":"true","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":303},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":305},{"type":"dialog","id":306},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":307},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":308},{"type":"charslot","id":309},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_bg_38_g5_rhinelab_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#8$1","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#9$1","id":312},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":313},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":314},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"1.5","id":315},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"我记得......是卡罗琳前辈在负责观测。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1047_halo2_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃琳娜","text":"难道说......","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D3/Avg_avg_1047_halo2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":322},{"type":"charslot","id":323},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stonesmashmetalwall","volume":"0.5","id":324},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"8","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":325},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":326},{"type":"text","text":"愤怒的呼喊声隔着金属墙壁模糊地传入所有人耳中。","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"村民的声音","text":"把圣山还给我们！还给谢拉格！还给耶拉冈德！","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"村民的声音","text":"从耶拉冈德的土地上滚出去！","id":329},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":331},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":332},{"type":"charslot","id":333},{"type":"image","id":334}],"characters":["缪尔赛思","赫默","？？？","诺希斯","能量科研究员","埃琳娜","村民的声音"]}